          <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            <li>• <strong>Inches to feet:</strong> Divide inches by 12 (e.g., 54 in ÷ 12 = 4.5 ft)</li>
