            <li>• <strong>Meters to feet:</strong> Multiply meters by 3.28084 (or divide by 0.3048)</li>
            <li>• <strong>Centimeters to feet:</strong> Divide centimeters by 30.48 (e.g., 300 cm ÷ 30.48 = 9.84 ft)</li>
